		<summary>Eric's tower defense adventure</summary>
		<desc>Made by Eric, a 7-year-old boy.

Defend Elderglen across five regions and 25 monster waves. Build Archer,
Cannon, and Frost towers, upgrade your defenses, and earn diamonds and spells.
Play offline with touch controls designed for a landscape Android tablet.

This is an early beta in a developer-operated custom F-Droid repository.
There are no accounts, advertising, tracking, or in-app purchases.
Saved progress stays on the device. The beta installs separately from the
original debug preview and does not import that preview's saved progress.
</desc>
